{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26519","headline":"久居京师感怀诗 · 费冠卿","name":"久居京师感怀诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茕独不爲苦，求名始辛酸。\n上国无交亲，请谒多少难。\n九月风到面，羞汗成冰片。\n求名俟公道，名与公道远。\n力尽得一名，他喜我且轻。\n家书十年绝，归去知谁荣。\n马嘶渭桥柳，特地起秋声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"费冠卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26519.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26519","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}